  {
    "location": "html-block:64",
    "text": "Full Scheme and High Performance Distance Protection",
    "heading": "MiCOM P44x"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:65",
    "text": "Part of PowerLogic™",
    "heading": "MiCOM P44x"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:66",
    "text": "Easergy MiCOM P44x provides high speed and high performance distance protection for all overhead lines and cable applications and offers a comprehensive range of protection functions as standard. Models available: MiCOM P441, MiCOM P442, MiCOM P443, MiCOM P444, MiCOM P445, MiCOM P446",
    "heading": "MiCOM P44x"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:67",
    "text": "Ask the community",
    "heading": "MiCOM P44x"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:68",
    "text": "Contact sales",
    "heading": "MiCOM P44x"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:69",
    "text": "Support Center",
    "heading": "MiCOM P44x"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:70",
    "text": "Read more",
    "heading": "MiCOM P44x"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:71",
    "text": "Ask the community",
    "heading": "MiCOM P44x"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:72",
    "text": "Contact sales",
    "heading": "MiCOM P44x"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:73",
    "text": "Support Center",
    "heading": "MiCOM P44x"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:74",
    "text": "Overview",
    "heading": "MiCOM P44x"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:75",
    "text": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:76",
    "text": "MiCOM P44x provides high-speed Distance protection for all overhead lines and cable applications and offers a comprehensive range of protection functions as standard. It is complemented by various serial and Ethernet communication protocols including IEC61850 and a multi-language HMI featuring English, French, German, Spanish, Russian and Chinese. Protection is further enhanced by the use of Programmable Scheme Logic within the device.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:77",
    "text": "The range offers quadrilateral (polygon) or mho characteristics with a long history of high performance, load blinding areas, comprehensive range of teleprotection schemes, Power swing alarm and blocking and Multishot autoreclosure with check synchronism.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:78",
    "text": "Housed in 40TE, 60TE or 80TE, 4U case sizes, this advanced distance protection range has fault clearance times of 0.7 to 1 cycle depending on model. P441, P442 and P443 operate on Quadrilateral distance characteristics, whereas P443, P445 and P446 offer Mho distance characteristics.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:79",
    "text": "Contractual warranty",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:80",
    "text": "Period : 2 years",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:81",
    "text": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:82",
    "text": "Proven experience and fastest operating times",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:83",
    "text": "Extensive distance protection experience and algorithms using “Delta algorithm”, “Mho” and Impedance measurement techniques.",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:84",
    "text": "“Mho” pedigree with over 25 years experience",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:85",
    "text": "Wide choice of channel aided scheme",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:86",
    "text": "Relay determines its own settings from protected line data (Mho models)",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:87",
    "text": "Setting free power swing detection and unblocking for the faults during swings (Mho models)",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:88",
    "text": "Applications"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:89",
    "text": "Multifunctional Distance protection devices with a full range of backup protection functions provides the user to selective protection and to trip for line faults in:",
    "heading": "Applications"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:90",
    "text": "Overhead lines and underground cables",
    "heading": "Applications"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:91",
    "text": "Lines with multiple zero sequence sources",
    "heading": "Applications"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:92",
    "text": "Non-homogeneous lines, series compensated lines, parallel lines",
    "heading": "Applications"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:93",
    "text": "Distribution to Transmission Voltage levels",
    "heading": "Applications"
  },
